  "content": "\n\n<a href=\"https://lunapixel.studio/bisect\"><img width=100% src=\"https://res.cloudinary.com/obscuria/image/upload/v1769702795/bisect.png\"></a>\n\n<center>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fragmentum-fabric\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Fabric\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Fabric-5b213b?style=for-the-badge\"></a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fragmentum-forge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Forge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Forge-5b2135?style=for-the-badge\"></a>\n    <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/fragmentum-neoforge\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"NeoForge\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/badge/Neo Forge-5b212e?style=for-the-badge\"></a>\n    <a href=\"https://discord.gg/jSHHJSUWdY\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img alt=\"Discord\" src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/899742852681191444?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white&label= &labelColor=231C25&color=5b2121\"></a>\n</center>\n\n<br>\n\n### <center>Fragmentum 是一款輕量級核心框架，旨在簡化 Obscuria 系列中跨平台模組的開發與維護流程。它本身不會為遊戲新增任何內容，也並非供其他模組開發者作為通用函式庫使用。</center>",
